  "title": "Cowboy Chicken",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are baked in a spicy sweet sauce. Adjust the heat by selecting the salsa of your choice. The sauce will be DELICIOUS and is yummy over rice or scooped up with corn chips or tortillas. Quick ... easy ... delicious! My kids love it and so does hubby!",
